        },
        {
          "tag": "h1",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "No time?<br><em>Caresse handles it.</em>"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "Work, kids, exhaustion — intimacy is often the first thing set aside. Caresse creates a simple, guided ritual for couples with packed schedules: minimal to configure, maximum to feel."
