    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "problem"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "problem-inner"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-label"
              },
              "html": "The real problem"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "No time for intimacy?<br>Make the moment you do have count."
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-sub problem-lede"
              },
              "html": "Intimacy with a busy schedule rarely fails for lack of desire. It fails for lack of occasion. When the free window finally arrives it is short, late and unplanned, and that is exactly when couples find they no longer know what to do with it. Caresse doesn't ask you to clear an evening: it turns the twenty or thirty minutes you actually have into something shaped and intentional."
            },
            {
              "type": "cards",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "problem-grid"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "problem-card"
                  },
                  "html": "\n                    <h3>When there are kids and work</h3>\n                    <p>Between bedtimes, homework, late emails and a bedroom door that never quite closes, busy parents' intimacy becomes a logistics problem rather than a question of desire. Set the session up during the day, between meetings or on your commute, then start it in the evening once the house is finally quiet. Headphones or a speaker at low volume is enough: nothing to stage, nothing to explain, the experience is already prepared and waiting.</p>\n                "
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "problem-card"
                  },
                  "html": "\n                    <h3>When you both end the day exhausted</h3>\n                    <p>Tiredness is rarely a lack of wanting; it's a lack of energy to initiate. Someone has to suggest it, find the words, carry the moment, and nobody wants that job at 11pm. Here the voice takes the initiative: it sets the atmosphere, holds the pace and guides from start to finish. You don't have to perform, and you don't have to decide for two. Lying down and listening is enough for something to happen, even on the nights you assumed you had nothing left to give.</p>\n                "
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "problem-card"
                  },
                  "html": "\n                    <h3>When your windows are short and unpredictable</h3>\n                    <p>A nap that runs long, a dinner that gets cancelled, a Sunday morning with no alarm: time together rarely shows up when you scheduled it. A session runs between 25 and 35 minutes and stops whenever you decide, which makes it workable in a window you never saw coming. You don't need to know in advance when you'll have time, only to be ready when it appears.</p>\n                "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "problem-outro"
              },
              "html": "Learning to make time for intimacy is less about willpower than about friction. Remove the preparation, the mental load and the fear of the awkward silence, and what's left is the thing you were after: a short moment together that actually counts. If your difficulty is settled routine more than a packed calendar, <a href=\"/en/for-long-term-couples/\">Caresse for long-term couples</a> covers that case, and our guide on <a href=\"/en/blog/rekindle-relationship-spark/\">how to rekindle the spark in a relationship</a> goes into how desire works over time."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "benefits"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Why Caresse for busy couples?"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Intimacy doesn't require hours."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "Lack of time isn't inevitable. Caresse transforms a free window into a moment that truly counts."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "benefits-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">⚡</div>\n                \n                <h3>Ready in minutes</h3>\n                \n                <p>Configure a session in 5 minutes or less. No elaborate planning, no preparation — Caresse does the creative work for you.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🎯</div>\n                \n                <h3>Zero mental load</h3>\n                \n                <p>You don't have to come up with ideas, \"set the mood,\" or plan. You choose your preferences and Caresse creates the experience for you.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🌙</div>\n                \n                <h3>Whenever you want</h3>\n                \n                <p>Late evening, weekend morning, unexpected moment — Caresse adapts to your schedule, not the other way. No \"romantic evening\" to organize.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🔋</div>\n                \n                <h3>Even when tired</h3>\n                \n                <p>No energy needed to initiate. The voice guides, creates the atmosphere, and carries the experience — you just need to be there and listen.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
