                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "timeline-content"
                  },
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Settle in and listen"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Headphones on, lights dimmed. The voice takes over — you have nothing to do but feel."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "faq"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Frequently asked questions"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "What you want to know"
        },
        {
          "type": "faq",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq-list"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "How long does a Caresse session last?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Session length varies based on your preferences — generally between 25 and 35 minutes. You can stop at any time if you wish."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Do both partners need to be available at the same time?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "In duo mode, yes — but configuration can be done in advance and the session launched when you're both ready. Caresse can also be used in solo mode if one of you is available alone."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Is it really as simple as described?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Free demos let you discover the voice and format without a Caresse account. To create a session from your preferences, configure it in the app and use a paid credit, without a subscription."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can you configure a session in advance for the same evening?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes — you can configure your session during the day and launch it in the evening when you finally have a moment. The session is generated in moments and waits for you, ready to launch."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "What if one of us is too tired in the evening?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Fatigue is precisely one of the cases Caresse was designed for. The voice guides and carries the experience — you don't need to \"perform\" or find energy. Lying down and listening is enough for the experience to unfold."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "How do you make time for intimacy when you're busy?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "By shrinking what has to be decided once the time does free up. The obstacle is almost never the duration itself, it's the preparation: finding the idea, setting the mood, being the one to initiate. Caresse takes that part on, which makes a 20 or 30 minute window genuinely usable instead of something you let slip by."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can you keep intimacy alive as parents with kids at home?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes, as long as it doesn't depend on a whole free evening or an empty house. Set the session up during the day and start it once the kids are down, using headphones or a speaker at low volume. You can stop at any point without losing what has already been generated."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Caresse actually help maintain a long-term relationship?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Regular intimacy is one of the pillars of a fulfilling relationship — but it's often the first thing sacrificed by daily life. Caresse creates a simple, accessible ritual so these moments exist, even during busy periods."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
